---
title: "join_vec_and_transfer (Sui Framework: pay)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_empty: assert coins.length() > 0
    q_check_empty --> q_abort: empty vector
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENoCoins
    q_check_empty --> q_pop: coins not empty
    q_pop --> q_loop: self = coins.pop_back()
    q_loop --> q_join: for each coin in coins
    q_join --> q_loop: self.join(coin)
    q_loop --> [*]: transfer::public_transfer(self, receiver)

    note right of q_pop
        INV-001: at least one coin required
        INV-002: all coins merged into single coin
        INV-003: total value preserved across join operations
        INV-004: transferred to receiver (not necessarily sender)
    end note
